---
import Layout from '../../layouts/Layout.astro';
import Nav from '../../components/Nav.astro';
import Footer from '../../components/Footer.astro';
---

<Layout
  title="Careers | Toile Blanche | Saint-Paul de Vence"
  description="Join the team behind the artwork. Open positions at Toile Blanche, Saint-Paul de Vence."
>
  <Nav theme="light" />

  <main>
    <section class="info-header">
      <div class="info-header-inner">
        <p class="info-eyebrow">The Team</p>
        <h1>Careers</h1>
        <p class="info-tagline">Toile Blanche is a living artwork that operates as a hotel. The people who run it are as important as the walls that hold it.</p>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="info-body">
      <div class="info-body-inner">
        <h2>Why Toile Blanche</h2>
        <p>We are a small team working inside a singular property — 22 suites, two restaurants, 20,000m² of gardens, and a contemporary art collection curated by the owners. The environment is intimate, the standards are high, and the culture is one of mutual respect.</p>

        <h2>What We Value</h2>
        <p><strong>Craft over routine.</strong> Every role here involves care — whether you are arranging a suite, plating a dish, or welcoming a guest at the gate. We hire people who take pride in the details.</p>
        <p><strong>Growth.</strong> We invest in training, and we promote from within whenever possible. Several of our senior team started in entry-level positions.</p>
        <p><strong>Inclusivity.</strong> We are committed to hiring 5% of our staff from young people with fewer opportunities in the job market.</p>

        <h2>Open Positions</h2>
        <p>We recruit throughout the year for seasonal and permanent roles across hospitality, kitchen, service, housekeeping, and grounds. If no specific position is listed, we still welcome spontaneous applications.</p>

        <h2>Apply</h2>
        <p>Send your CV and a short note about yourself to:</p>
        <p><a href="mailto:nicolas@toileblanche.com">nicolas@toileblanche.com</a></p>
      </div>
    </section>
  </main>

  <Footer />
</Layout>

<style>
  @import '/css/info-page.css';
</style>
